<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - K-Swiss raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - K-Swiss raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its rating on K-Swiss Inc to near-term accumulate from neutral, and kept the long-term rating at accumulate.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-1/4 to 12-1/2.</p>
</text>
